      "text": "\n\n1.should we pass songs in mixer to mix or call interally for songs??\n\nwhen to use interface ?? \n    -> same capability : dj/recom providing songs same method but diff \n                            implementation\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
