      "updated": 1786464533717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Generate a playlist of a requested size.\n2. Retrieve songs from both services.\n3. Support equal source distribution.\n4. Support custom source proportions.\n5. Apply user-preference filters.\n6. Avoid duplicate songs.\n7. Preserve the requested ratio where possible.\n8. Interleave songs from both sources.\n9. Fill shortages using the other source.\n10. Return a partial playlist or explicit failure when insufficient songs exist.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Generate a playlist of a requested size.\n2. Retrieve songs from both services.\n3. Support equal source distribution.\n4. Support custom source proportions.\n5. Apply user-preference filters.\n6. Avoid duplicate songs.\n7. Preserve the requested ratio where possible.\n8. Interleave songs from both sources.\n9. Fill shortages using the other source.\n10. Return a partial playlist or explicit failure when insufficient songs exist.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ayYpA393wVDpwDLuRwOIs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -61.92338591378871,
      "y": -755.0122133389706,
      "width": 1155,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 126593379,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 1386611021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786464625370,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nDesign a playlist from the DJservice and the Recommendation service to mix the songs .\nGiven the list of 10 requirements printed on paper . \nThe core idea is to mix the songs coming from the Djservice and the recommendation service ,\n in a custom proportion or in a equal proportion . Filters can be applied based on the user preferances .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nDesign a playlist from the DJservice and the Recommendation service to mix the songs .\nGiven the list of 10 requirements printed on paper . \nThe core idea is to mix the songs coming from the Djservice and the recommendation service ,\n in a custom proportion or in a equal proportion . Filters can be applied based on the user preferances .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "spBJok_SOfhjAvto5U0tg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1015.2140934734641,
      "y": -573.6385484249656,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
