      "updated": 1786472192009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Keep these classes\n\nPlaylistGenerator          → orchestrates the use case\nSongSource interface       → common external-service contract\nDJSource                    → adapts DJService\nRecommendationSource        → adapts RecommendationService\nSongFilter interface        → evaluates one song\nCompositeSongFilter         → combines genre/language/mood filters\nSongMixer                   → allocation, shortage handling and interleaving\nPlaylistRequest             → size, preferences and mix configuration\n\nRemove for now\n\nRule\nHistory\nEqualProportionStrategy\nCustomProportionStrategy\nMixingStrategy interface\nSongAllocator interface\nSongOrdering interface",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Keep these classes\n\nPlaylistGenerator          → orchestrates the use case\nSongSource interface       → common external-service contract\nDJSource                    → adapts DJService\nRecommendationSource        → adapts RecommendationService\nSongFilter interface        → evaluates one song\nCompositeSongFilter         → combines genre/language/mood filters\nSongMixer                   → allocation, shortage handling and interleaving\nPlaylistRequest             → size, preferences and mix configuration\n\nRemove for now\n\nRule\nHistory\nEqualProportionStrategy\nCustomProportionStrategy\nMixingStrategy interface\nSongAllocator interface\nSongOrdering interface",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
