      "updated": 1786472894403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Split into separate classes when a behavior:(songmixer)\n\n• Has multiple algorithms.\n• Changes independently.\n• Is complex enough to test independently.\n• Is reused elsewhere.\n• Requires different dependencies.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Split into separate classes when a behavior:(songmixer)\n\n• Has multiple algorithms.\n• Changes independently.\n• Is complex enough to test independently.\n• Is reused elsewhere.\n• Requires different dependencies.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Jd_yf1Yfq8vBpgcbKOx4L",
