      "text": "LLD: \nCalculate fees for stocks,bonds etc.\nEach type has a given rate and some conditions. \nThere also rules that apply to all types of equities.\nMust ride code where we can new entities, rules etc. Basically extendible.  \n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28.621611661434788,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LLD: \nCalculate fees for stocks,bonds etc.\nEach type has a given rate and some conditions. \nThere also rules that apply to all types of equities.\nMust ride code where we can new entities, rules etc. Basically extendible.  \n\n\n\n\n",
