      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nstage 1; \n\n\nInterface IStage{\n \n    next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf);\n}\n\n\nClass NoiseFilterStage : IStage{\n    IStage* nextStage;\n    \n    NoiseFilterStage(IStage stage){\n        nextstage = stage;\n    } \n\n     next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf){\n            //perfrom action on adbuf\n\n            nextStage->next(adbuf);\n     }\n\n}\n\n\nClass GainStage : IStage{\n    IStage* nextStage;\n    \n    GainStage(IStage stage){\n        nextstage = stage;\n    } \n\n     next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf){\n            //perfrom action on adbuf\n\n            nextStage->next(adbuf);\n     }\n\n}\n\n\nnoisefilter ---> gain ---> quality ---> {audio buffer modified}\n\n\nIStage = new NoiseFilterStage(new GainStage(new qualityEnhance(NUll)));\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nstage 1; \n\n\nInterface IStage{\n \n    next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf);\n}\n\n\nClass NoiseFilterStage : IStage{\n    IStage* nextStage;\n    \n    NoiseFilterStage(IStage stage){\n        nextstage = stage;\n    } \n\n     next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf){\n            //perfrom action on adbuf\n\n            nextStage->next(adbuf);\n     }\n\n}\n\n\nClass GainStage : IStage{\n    IStage* nextStage;\n    \n    GainStage(IStage stage){\n        nextstage = stage;\n    } \n\n     next(AudioBuffer[] adbuf){\n            //perfrom action on adbuf\n\n            nextStage->next(adbuf);\n     }\n\n}\n\n\nnoisefilter ---> gain ---> quality ---> {audio buffer modified}\n\n\nIStage = new NoiseFilterStage(new GainStage(new qualityEnhance(NUll)));\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zD0-UL-OXa3FAw3dRR9wo",
