      "seed": 1911304200,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 1522322808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786655761892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The core difference",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The core difference",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QWNP9lDKGRQGfbqYY4spY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10746.228532073561,
      "y": 1043.997001342568,
      "width": 785.3997802734375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b05",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 372552824,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 1569836920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786655764931,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Option 1 (IStage → Stage → FilterStage) has an\nabstract/intermediate class between the interface\nand the concrete class. That middle class exists to\nhold shared logic that multiple stages will reuse —\nnot just to satisfy the interface.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 1 (IStage → Stage → FilterStage) has an abstract/intermediate class between the interface and the concrete class. That middle class exists to hold shared logic that multiple stages will reuse — not just to satisfy the interface.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dmEXnK5ujoALi9sOYa0V6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10753.928544280592,
      "y": 1308.997001342568,
      "width": 769.999755859375,
      "height": 1120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 469298952,
      "version": 130,
      "versionNonce": 1180683128,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786655858091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Option 2 (IStage → FilterStage directly) is a flat\nimplementation. Nothing is shared; every stage\nbuilds itself from scratch.\n\nclass Istage{\n    \n    process(int val){}\n    \n}\n\n\nclass stage: istage{\n\n    proces(int val){\n        //shared logic\n    }\n    \n    virtual void doprocess(){}\n\n}\n\n\nclass filterstage: istage{\n    \n    doprocess(int val){\n        //implemtn fliter logic \n    }\n    \n}\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 2 (IStage → FilterStage directly) is a flat implementation. Nothing is shared; every stage builds itself from scratch.\n\nclass Istage{\n    \n    process(int val){}\n    \n}\n\n\nclass stage: istage{\n\n    proces(int val){\n        //shared logic\n    }\n    \n    virtual void doprocess(){}\n\n}\n\n\nclass filterstage: istage{\n    \n    doprocess(int val){\n        //implemtn fliter logic \n    }\n    \n}\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rYI_HIsFbhjcgI4O_fWZk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10321.285319767048,
      "y": 157.65359817899594,
      "width": 769.9996948242188,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1896991048,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 327127352,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786682775664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Not Thread-Safe (BlockingQueue): Your queue\nimplementation manipulates standard std::queue\nwithout standard thread synchronization\n(std::mutex, std::condition_variable). If two\nstages attempt to push and pop concurrently on\ndifferent threads, it will lead to race conditions\nand memory corruption.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Not Thread-Safe (BlockingQueue): Your queue implementation manipulates standard std::queue without standard thread synchronization (std::mutex, std::condition_variable). If two stages attempt to push and pop concurrently on different threads, it will lead to race conditions and memory corruption.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bjk09m_9DeybdPpX5iLfC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10358.828767933108,
      "y": 2795.7475433617383,
      "width": 1493.6956787109375,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1360224056,
      "version": 263,
      "versionNonce": 1081494328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786685308486,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                              ┌── Thread A (Processes Frame 1) ──┐\n                              │                                  │\n[NoiseFilter] ──► [Queue] ────┼── Thread B (Processes Frame 2) ──┼──► [Reordering Queue] ──► Next\n                              │                                  │\n                              └── Thread C (Processes Frame 3) ──┘\n\nSOlution of bottleneck stage like\n\nnoisefilter 3 ms each frame\ngrain is taking 9 ms each frame \n\nassign 3 parallel thread to the gain filter queue ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                              ┌── Thread A (Processes Frame 1) ──┐\n                              │                                  │\n[NoiseFilter] ──► [Queue] ────┼── Thread B (Processes Frame 2) ──┼──► [Reordering Queue] ──► Next\n                              │                                  │\n                              └── Thread C (Processes Frame 3) ──┘\n\nSOlution of bottleneck stage like\n\nnoisefilter 3 ms each frame\ngrain is taking 9 ms each frame \n\nassign 3 parallel thread to the gain filter queue ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Lt_qkpDAC8W_CpSm9YbMN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10467.496149752707,
      "y": 2472.2388400487166,
      "width": 923.9996948242188,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1065513016,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 875488824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786686508696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CPU Spikes & Starvation (Busy Waiting)\nWithout a condition variable, a consumer thread checking \nan empty queue has to continuously loop and check for items:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CPU Spikes & Starvation (Busy Waiting)\nWithout a condition variable, a consumer thread checking \nan empty queue has to continuously loop and check for items:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QDdxL0O5EBNiA7Sj_O4Oa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10198.277688611413,
      "y": 2313.547396167346,
      "width": 723.7997436523438,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 78021448,
      "version": 169,
      "versionNonce": 1081416520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786687167348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "untill queue is empty cv make thread\nsleeps and release the mutex lock.\nso push thread aquire it and notify once pushed",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "untill queue is empty cv make thread\nsleeps and release the mutex lock.\nso push thread aquire it and notify once pushed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FnelAvUT2CM2i_EhOpJyh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10361.79023891968,
      "y": 3635.0976014729226,
      "width": 677.599853515625,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 95255880,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 907688760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786688589777,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "nsfilter --> stageobj(q0,q1)\ngainstage --> stageobj(q1,q2)\n\nthread1 pushing in q1\nthread2 poping from q1 in gainfilter\n\nconcurrancy--> bz internally multiple steps \nhappen to queue like\n- add data to new memory\n- increase pointer\n- increase size   ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "nsfilter --> stageobj(q0,q1)\ngainstage --> stageobj(q1,q2)\n\nthread1 pushing in q1\nthread2 poping from q1 in gainfilter\n\nconcurrancy--> bz internally multiple steps \nhappen to queue like\n- add data to new memory\n- increase pointer\n- increase size   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Sjr60JPo53-_6-sT7Kgjo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10343.847113298203,
      "y": 4274.940384843054,
      "width": 1247.399658203125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 493454664,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 110741064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786689542884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Main Thread                 Worker Thread\n    │                             │\n    ├─── start() ────────────────►├─ [Spawns new thread]\n    │    (Returns instantly)      │  runLoop() starts processing frames...\n    │                             │  while (running) { ... }\n    │                             │\n    ├─── stop()                   │\n    │    sets running = false ───►│\n    │    workerThread.join()      │  Finishes current frame, breaks loop,\n    │    ◄── (Waits for exit) ────┼─ Exits thread cleanly\n    ▼                             ▼\nKey Takeaway\nstart() spins up a parallel execution lane so audio frames process concurrently, \nwhile stop() gracefully signals the thread to stop and waits for\n a clean exit without cutting off active memory operations.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Main Thread                 Worker Thread\n    │                             │\n    ├─── start() ────────────────►├─ [Spawns new thread]\n    │    (Returns instantly)      │  runLoop() starts processing frames...\n    │                             │  while (running) { ... }\n    │                             │\n    ├─── stop()                   │\n    │    sets running = false ───►│\n    │    workerThread.join()      │  Finishes current frame, breaks loop,\n    │    ◄── (Waits for exit) ────┼─ Exits thread cleanly\n    ▼                             ▼\nKey Takeaway\nstart() spins up a parallel execution lane so audio frames process concurrently, \nwhile stop() gracefully signals the thread to stop and waits for\n a clean exit without cutting off active memory operations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uovZzEJapw0H1LSOK-BBD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7752.649805331654,
      "y": 4805.868745353079,
      "width": 1231.999755859375,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
