      "originalText": "Interface IPayment{\n    bool pay(Booking booking){}\n}\n\nclass CardPayment : IPayment{\n    Card : card\n    \n    CardPayment(Card card){\n        this.card = card\n    }\n\n    bool pay(Booking booking){\n\n        //proces card payment\n    }\n\n}\n\n\nclass UPIPayment : IPayment{\n    string : upiId\n    \n    CardPayment(string upid){\n        this.upiId = upid\n    }\n\n    bool pay(Booking booking){\n        //booking.amount\n        //proces upipayment\n    }\n\n}",
