      "seed": 33257697,
      "version": 801,
      "versionNonce": 554864513,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787829475541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a chat application like Whatsapp. The app should support:\n1:1 chats, Group chats\nGuaranteed delivery of messages\nDelete messages once delivered\n\n\nnon functional requirement\n- avialability > consistent\n- latency < 300ms\n- scable upto 1B DAU\n\n\n\nenties:\n\nGroup{\n  GroupId\n  title\n  profileDPurl\n  decription\n}\nChat{\n   chatid\n   groupid\n}\n\nParticipants{\n   praticipanId\n   chatid\n   userid\n}\n\nMessage\nUser\n\n\nAPI:\n\n\n WS ws \n\nheader JWT bearer alias -> \n\n    /SEND   \n    {\n        chatid\n        message\n        mediaurl\n        timestamp\n    } \n    \n\n\n      \n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a chat application like Whatsapp. The app should support:\n1:1 chats, Group chats\nGuaranteed delivery of messages\nDelete messages once delivered\n\n\nnon functional requirement\n- avialability > consistent\n- latency < 300ms\n- scable upto 1B DAU\n\n\n\nenties:\n\nGroup{\n  GroupId\n  title\n  profileDPurl\n  decription\n}\nChat{\n   chatid\n   groupid\n}\n\nParticipants{\n   praticipanId\n   chatid\n   userid\n}\n\nMessage\nUser\n\n\nAPI:\n\n\n WS ws \n\nheader JWT bearer alias -> \n\n    /SEND   \n    {\n        chatid\n        message\n        mediaurl\n        timestamp\n    } \n    \n\n\n      \n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
