      "text": "\nBookResponse[] addbooks(BookRequest[] books){\n    //LOCK ON BOOKCOPY\n      // check in bookmap\n    // remove the book from bookmap\n    // add it to borrowbookmap\n    //update status in book copy -> booked\n}\n\nint removBook(Book books){\n    // remove the books\n\n}\n\nint borrowBook(book){\n    \n}\n\nint rentbook(book){\n\n}\n\nBook[] getbooks(keyword){\n    //filter the books based on keyword\n    // from bookmap\n    return list[]\n}",
      "fontSize": 29.448003017951088,
