      "text": "bool requestLift(FloorRequest req){\n    if(req.type == floor)\n       LiftManger = AssignLift(req);\n    else\n       liftManger= req.lift\n\n    liftManager.addrequest(req);\n}\n\nLiftManager AssignLift(FloorRequest req){\n    return liftstrategy.assignlift(req);\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "bool requestLift(FloorRequest req){\n    if(req.type == floor)\n       LiftManger = AssignLift(req);\n    else\n       liftManger= req.lift\n\n    liftManager.addrequest(req);\n}\n\nLiftManager AssignLift(FloorRequest req){\n    return liftstrategy.assignlift(req);\n}",
