      "updated": 1788003632479,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DESIGN INTENT\n• FeeCalculator orchestrates; it does not know stock/bond formulas.\n• FeeRule combines scope + applicability conditions + fee calculation.\n• Condition answers: Should this rule apply?\n• FeeCalculation answers: How much should be charged?\n• New values/rates come from config; new behavior gets a new implementation.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DESIGN INTENT\n• FeeCalculator orchestrates; it does not know stock/bond formulas.\n• FeeRule combines scope + applicability conditions + fee calculation.\n• Condition answers: Should this rule apply?\n• FeeCalculation answers: How much should be charged?\n• New values/rates come from config; new behavior gets a new implementation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
