    {
      "id": "SMFWkXVi5spo1l2748dfp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6426.494644741952,
      "y": 1634.6209195217693,
      "width": 496.875,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1391293059,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 1323402787,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788003632479,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY THIS IS EXTENSIBLE\n=================================================\nChange requested          Files changed   Files added\n-------------------------------------------------\nNew rate / threshold            0              0\nNew rule                        0              0\nNew instrument (CRYPTO)         0              0\nNew condition type              1 (registry)   1\nNew calculation type            1 (registry)   1\n\nNothing scales with the NUMBER of rules.\nOnly new BEHAVIOUR costs code.\n\nThe proof: FeeCalculator has no\n   if (instrument == STOCK) ...\nanywhere. That absence IS the extensibility.\n\n3 decisions that bought it:\n  1. instrument type = String, not enum\n  2. empty list means \"applies to ALL\"\n  3. factory uses a Map registry, not a switch",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY THIS IS EXTENSIBLE\n=================================================\nChange requested          Files changed   Files added\n-------------------------------------------------\nNew rate / threshold            0              0\nNew rule                        0              0\nNew instrument (CRYPTO)         0              0\nNew condition type              1 (registry)   1\nNew calculation type            1 (registry)   1\n\nNothing scales with the NUMBER of rules.\nOnly new BEHAVIOUR costs code.\n\nThe proof: FeeCalculator has no\n   if (instrument == STOCK) ...\nanywhere. That absence IS the extensibility.\n\n3 decisions that bought it:\n  1. instrument type = String, not enum\n  2. empty list means \"applies to ALL\"\n  3. factory uses a Map registry, not a switch",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5rqRI5vla6zNoTO_DADm8",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -5741.494644741952,
      "y": 1609.6209195217693,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 603.4449311250189,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6W",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1245850147,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 1102236099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
