      "text": "Eelevator System: \n\n1. mulitple lifts and multiple floors\n2. up/down button on each floor with display\n3. lift contain floor button open/close button\n4. user press button from floor or lift.\n5. lift should be assigned based on the appropriste strategy\n\n",
