      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Parking Lot \n\nrequirements: \n- park and unpark vehicale from parking spot\n- support multi level parking\n- support diff vehicle type\n- create ticket on entry and unreserve the parking spot\n- support multiple payment method\n\n\n",
