      "updated": 1788120476916,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-put reserve or held status ... bz inbwt system fails \n- so we might need to revert it ... put expirytime in case\n it still held for more then 5 min\n- run the cleanup activity to cleanup those expiry times\n\n\nOption 2 — Lazy expiration (for handling held expiration)\n\nYou can avoid a dedicated cleanup thread.\n\nWhenever someone tries to use a spot:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-put reserve or held status ... bz inbwt system fails \n- so we might need to revert it ... put expirytime in case\n it still held for more then 5 min\n- run the cleanup activity to cleanup those expiry times\n\n\nOption 2 — Lazy expiration (for handling held expiration)\n\nYou can avoid a dedicated cleanup thread.\n\nWhenever someone tries to use a spot:",
