      "originalText": "Job Scheduler:\n\n1. job can have low/med/high priority\n2. job can we scheduled or imidiate\n3. job should have retry polices\n4. job can be cancelled if not already processed\n\n\n\nenum priority\nJobScheduler\nJob\nretryPolicies //strategies\njobrepository\n\n\n\nenum priority{\n    HIGH(1)\n    MEDIUM(2)\n    LOW(3)\n}\n\nenum status{\n    SCHEDULED\n    QUEUED\n    RUNNING\n    COMPLETED\n    FAILED\n    CANCELLED\n}\n\nclass jobrequest{\n    schedultedAt\n    priority\n    jobid\n}\n\nclass Job{\n    jobid\n    jobtype\n    priority\n    Task\n    scheduledAt\n    retryPolicy(ENUM)\n    retryCount\n    maxRetryCount\n    \n}\n\nclass orchastrator{\n\n\n    thread A  = JobWorker(scheduler,executor)\n    thread B  = JobWorker(scheduler,executor)\n\n}\n\n\nclass JobScheduler{\n   Priority_queue<Job> scheduleQueue; // min-heap on scheduleTime\n   Priority_queue<Job> readyQueue  // min heap on priority (use comparator that)\n   mutex mt\n\n    void schedulingloop(){\n        while(running){\n\n            mt.lock();\n            \n            cv.wait(lock, !scheduleQueue.empty())\n\n            if(!scheduleQueue.empty()){\n                \n                nextjob = schedulequeue.top()\n\n                if(nextjob.scheduleAt <= now){\n\n                    nextjob.status = 'QUEUED'\n                    readyqueue.push(job)\n                    schedulequeue.pop()\n                }\n                    \n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    Job acquireJob(){\n         mt.lock()\n         \n        cv.wait(lock,!readyqueue.empty())  // release lock and wait untill queue is \n                                           // non-empty and thread went to sleep\n        \n         if(readyqueue.empty())\n             return NULL\n        \n        job = readyqueue.top()\n            readyqueue.pop()\n\n        if(job.status == 'CANCELED')\n            RETURN null\n\n        job.status = 'RUNNING'\n        jobrepo.updatedstatus(job)\n\n        return job\n             \n     }\n\npublic: \n\n     jobid submitJob(Job job){\n          mt.lock()\n\n          jobrepo.savejob(job)\n        \n         if(Job.scheduledTime <= now)\n            job.status = 'QUEUED'\n            readyqueue.push(Job)\n         else\n            job.status = 'SCHEDULED'\n            scheduledQueue.push(Job)\n         \n        cv.notify()\n     }\n\n     bool canceljob(Job job){\n        \n     }\n\n}\n\n",
