      "updated": 1788172078601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "where to filter based prefrence\nPros\n\nAvoids unnecessary queue messages.\nReduces queue size and worker load.\nCheaper at scale.\n\nCons\n\nPreference may change after you put the notification in the queue.\nYou need to read preferences synchronously, which can increase latency.\nIf the preference DB is unavailable, you may have trouble deciding whether to enqueue.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "where to filter based prefrence\nPros\n\nAvoids unnecessary queue messages.\nReduces queue size and worker load.\nCheaper at scale.\n\nCons\n\nPreference may change after you put the notification in the queue.\nYou need to read preferences synchronously, which can increase latency.\nIf the preference DB is unavailable, you may have trouble deciding whether to enqueue.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
