      "text": "- avialability >> consistency\n- scaleable to 100*1000k/100k -> 1k per second -> 10x peak (10k per second)\n- near realtime update (minimum latency for the dashboard updates)(<500ms) (query read)\n- fault toleranent. can't loose any click\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
