      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- pre-aggregation improves query speed at the cost of extra storage and some freshness delay.\n- queries under a day use five-minute buckets while multi-month queries use daily buckets.\n     That makes the read-path behavior feel more concrete and easier to reason about. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- pre-aggregation improves query speed at the cost of extra storage and some freshness delay.\n- queries under a day use five-minute buckets while multi-month queries use daily buckets.\n     That makes the read-path behavior feel more concrete and easier to reason about. ",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 67,
