      "text": "Input: \n - api request with userid/clientid/Ip & rule id and rule will be loaded from config \n    store based identitfer\n\nOutput:\n - response obj with contains allow/rejected & error code with details and also pass helpful detaol\n like {isalloed , remainingcount, resettime}",
