      "versionNonce": 158288746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788555440278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for the rule updates:\n\ntwo models\n\n1. pull based model \n\n    rate limiter fetch the rules config and store in memory or cache\n\n2. push based model\n    \n    - zookeeper of configuration system push notification to rate limiter\n        which then modofies the local cache\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for the rule updates:\n\ntwo models\n\n1. pull based model \n\n    rate limiter fetch the rules config and store in memory or cache\n\n2. push based model\n    \n    - zookeeper of configuration system push notification to rate limiter\n        which then modofies the local cache\n",
