      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788607934106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POST   /payment-intents -> PaymentIntent\nbody :{\n     Merchant\n     OrderId\n     UserId\n     Amount\n     timestamp\n     expiretime\n}\n\nPOST  payment-intent/{PaymentIntentId}/transactions -> Transation\nbody:{\n    paymentType\n    carddetails\n}\n\nGET  /{userid}/status -> PaymentIntent[]\n\n (should we make user part of url or exract it from the header)\n\nGET payment-intents/{PaymentIntentId}/status -> PaymentIntent",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 499,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "POST   /payment-intents -> PaymentIntent\nbody :{\n     Merchant\n     OrderId\n     UserId\n     Amount\n     timestamp\n     expiretime\n}\n\nPOST  payment-intent/{PaymentIntentId}/transactions -> Transation\nbody:{\n    paymentType\n    carddetails\n}\n\nGET  /{userid}/status -> PaymentIntent[]\n\n (should we make user part of url or exract it from the header)\n\nGET payment-intents/{PaymentIntentId}/status -> PaymentIntent",
