    {
      "id": "l27d02mz7s84OG_elyZtX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18858.74134063935,
      "y": 9538.838581683742,
      "width": 1078,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1128129418,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 1137541194,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788608087603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n\n- Merchants should be able to initiate payment requests (charge a customer for a specific amount).\n- Users should be able to pay for products with credit/debit cards.\n- Merchants should be able to view status updates for payments (e.g., pending, success, failed).\n\nSysten Scale:\n10k QPS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n\n- Merchants should be able to initiate payment requests (charge a customer for a specific amount).\n- Users should be able to pay for products with credit/debit cards.\n- Merchants should be able to view status updates for payments (e.g., pending, success, failed).\n\nSysten Scale:\n10k QPS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qNa0vHmNEdJQvyt5IplvU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18873.268043964283,
      "y": 11301.844427605032,
      "width": 869,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1226130186,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 2065012310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788608404602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- why can't we maintain the strong consisitency in stripe like payment system??",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- why can't we maintain the strong consisitency in stripe like payment system??",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "U3zNFymJ4Jkz_PXGXrRhM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18871.922252187876,
      "y": 11359.713473990438,
      "width": 935,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1014965834,
      "version": 421,
      "versionNonce": 678638666,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788608693571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " payment provider is depends on payment network provider(handles the bank amount+-) \n which is async in nature. so there might be consisitency, late response provided\n\nso we say we support eventual consistency but finanacialy integraty(no double charge)\n\n(or no confirmation once charge)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " payment provider is depends on payment network provider(handles the bank amount+-) \n which is async in nature. so there might be consisitency, late response provided\n\nso we say we support eventual consistency but finanacialy integraty(no double charge)\n\n(or no confirmation once charge)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "B93qSoZfzaut7yb8RLmEw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21458.53404643785,
      "y": 10467.453526234074,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 102511190,
      "version": 270,
      "versionNonce": 1726420426,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788610267203,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this payment network providers are highly secure\nnot exposing api through public endpoint\n... have a secure binary protocol.. \nrequired seperate hardware to connect..\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this payment network providers are highly secure\nnot exposing api through public endpoint\n... have a secure binary protocol.. \nrequired seperate hardware to connect..\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YXoKEoqqzY-3PySGZvJKQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20925.894834693707,
      "y": 11667.904389430749,
      "width": 1188,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
