      "seed": 1166594518,
      "version": 420,
      "versionNonce": 884147862,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788642736654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- we need to make sure if we create compagin /schedule on monday and secheduled it on thrusday\n  then it should if ueser opt-out(disable) for email on tuesday on email then it should discard it.\n\n- Quiet hours apply to standard and bulk notifications but not critical ones, because nobody wants\n  their login code held until morning. When a check suppresses something, we record it as SUPPRESSED \n  with the reason rather than dropping it silently",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 139,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- we need to make sure if we create compagin /schedule on monday and secheduled it on thrusday\n  then it should if ueser opt-out(disable) for email on tuesday on email then it should discard it.\n\n- Quiet hours apply to standard and bulk notifications but not critical ones, because nobody wants\n  their login code held until morning. When a check suppresses something, we record it as SUPPRESSED \n  with the reason rather than dropping it silently",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "bF7",
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
