      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788642736654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "notificationid1 : ttl 5 hr\nnotificationid2 : ttl 5hr",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 43,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "notificationid1 : ttl 5 hr\nnotificationid2 : ttl 5hr",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "bFU",
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GMS_Clq4pPGOdoHIo568V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28888.961576927548,
      "y": 10840.497139293875,
      "width": 867.1875,
      "height": 72,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2050731990,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 386006870,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788642736654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The safer pattern is to record the sent outcome only after the provider\n acknowledges success, because writing it before the send can turn retries\n into a silent drop for a notification that was never actually delivered.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 67,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The safer pattern is to record the sent outcome only after the provider\n acknowledges success, because writing it before the send can turn retries\n into a silent drop for a notification that was never actually delivered.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "bFV",
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XuuZ-_kYMge72dJjcRdXm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 26371.483307133436,
      "y": 11060.708619691946,
      "width": 1125,
      "height": 216,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1310934294,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1591300950,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788672999828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The order matters more than the tools. Claiming the ID before sending feels natural, but a \nworker that claims and then crashes blocks every redelivery of a notification that was never \nsent, which quietly turns at-least-once into at-most-once.\n\nWe accept one narrow window. A worker that dies between the provider ack and the outcome write\n lets a rare duplicate through. And if the dedup store is unreachable, we send anyway and alert,\n because a duplicate beats a drop.\"\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 211,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The order matters more than the tools. Claiming the ID before sending feels natural, but a \nworker that claims and then crashes blocks every redelivery of a notification that was never \nsent, which quietly turns at-least-once into at-most-once.\n\nWe accept one narrow window. A worker that dies between the provider ack and the outcome write\n lets a rare duplicate through. And if the dedup store is unreachable, we send anyway and alert,\n because a duplicate beats a drop.\"\n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "bFW",
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
