      "text": "- update to the elastic search:\n  approach-01: -> crud service updates elastic search and db togetger\n                 complexity : failure handling, complex logic, what if one the write fails\n\n  \n  approach-02:  -> update the elastic search using cdc(if what ever event cahnge) \n                 cdc is big abstraction\n                elastic search have limitation on write throughput",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
