    {
      "id": "V64rhtHANrw1eXvK7V7zM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34135.133187612206,
      "y": 11585.525172830177,
      "width": 1755.599609375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 102452618,
      "version": 9,
      "versionNonce": 1394865162,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788684318718,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There isn't a fixed number because it depends on document size, shard count,\nreplicas, hardware, refresh interval, and concurrent search load.\nI'd benchmark the target workload. As a starting point, a properly sized cluster \ncan handle thousands of indexing operations per second, and we can scale horizontally by adding nodes/shards. \nI'd also use bulk indexing and Kafka-based buffering so temporary OpenSearch slowdowns don't block the producers.”",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There isn't a fixed number because it depends on document size, shard count,\nreplicas, hardware, refresh interval, and concurrent search load.\nI'd benchmark the target workload. As a starting point, a properly sized cluster \ncan handle thousands of indexing operations per second, and we can scale horizontally by adding nodes/shards. \nI'd also use bulk indexing and Kafka-based buffering so temporary OpenSearch slowdowns don't block the producers.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_UoO3s0THyAuCaUsThMbP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35923.94103162815,
      "y": 10887.397084191205,
      "width": 846.9996948242188,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1483094090,
      "version": 417,
      "versionNonce": 822915146,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788684604187,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "here there is issue for populer events seats got booked\nbut status still showing avaiable\n\nhow to fix it?\n\nshare the updates with client\n\n- by polling/long polling \n    - simple but still not real time\n\n- persistent connetion\n    - websocket (bydirectional ... not need it here)\n    - sse\n        good for single direction persistent connection\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "here there is issue for populer events seats got booked\nbut status still showing avaiable\n\nhow to fix it?\n\nshare the updates with client\n\n- by polling/long polling \n    - simple but still not real time\n\n- persistent connetion\n    - websocket (bydirectional ... not need it here)\n    - sse\n        good for single direction persistent connection\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
