    {
      "id": "1mTStkgBv7RCixSsIdG0x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33429.92433890789,
      "y": 10438.11781298944,
      "width": 446.5998229980469,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 278029974,
      "version": 135,
      "versionNonce": 1713806870,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788685420599,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "virtual waiting queue \n\nin case of hugh traffic or\ngood user experience like for\npopuler events, seats booked\ntoo quickly",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "virtual waiting queue \n\nin case of hugh traffic or\ngood user experience like for\npopuler events, seats booked\ntoo quickly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yiG72QUVHlROrxus3njNH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32901.38765913027,
      "y": 11002.23584786833,
      "width": 923.9996337890625,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 479453974,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1488622998,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788685743680,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis (using a sorted set with timestamps for ordering). SSE",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis (using a sorted set with timestamps for ordering). SSE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "It-7zdxLBobzbPvoocm4R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32885.596938810246,
      "y": 12123.37699059012,
      "width": 2078.99951171875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2030301962,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2067150986,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788686299333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure Data Factory CDC\n\nAzure Data Factory has a Change Data Capture resource that can continuously capture changed data and move it from a source to a target.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Azure Data Factory CDC\n\nAzure Data Factory has a Change Data Capture resource that can continuously capture changed data and move it from a source to a target.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AnN-TL8RGC1xBqYuveWuc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32843.48835129017,
      "y": 12381.292089150535,
      "width": 2263.79931640625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186563798,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 371851094,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788686319318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS — AWS DMS\n\nThe most common name to remember is AWS Database Migration Service (AWS DMS).\n\nAWS DMS supports CDC (ongoing replication). It reads changes from the source database's native logs and continuously replicates them to the target.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS — AWS DMS\n\nThe most common name to remember is AWS Database Migration Service (AWS DMS).\n\nAWS DMS supports CDC (ongoing replication). It reads changes from the source database's native logs and continuously replicates them to the target.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Rc-kCK6CP4b_cg-tck0he",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32838.22477785017,
      "y": 12628.680040830934,
      "width": 461.99981689453125,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 764357962,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 963109578,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788686331758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DB change\n   ↓\nTransaction Log\n   ↓\nCDC = Log Reader\n   ↓\nKafka/Event Hub\n   ↓\nConsumers\n   ↓\nOpenSearch / Cache / Analytics",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DB change\n   ↓\nTransaction Log\n   ↓\nCDC = Log Reader\n   ↓\nKafka/Event Hub\n   ↓\nConsumers\n   ↓\nOpenSearch / Cache / Analytics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QnYMHKTnZ4RHYc87hpKqB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38686.05486969956,
      "y": 8638.891373304552,
      "width": 1416.799560546875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 678356106,
      "version": 31,
      "versionNonce": 2049369494,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788689550091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DROPBOX:\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allows users to store and share files. \nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DROPBOX:\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allows users to store and share files. \nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-ModTE9C3vykejH5LgvXB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38688.52970611072,
      "y": 8945.725478145137,
      "width": 800.7996826171875,
      "height": 1575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1033621002,
      "version": 979,
      "versionNonce": 42519818,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788698642750,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement: \n\n- upload the file\n- download the file\n- sync file acrross multiple devices\n\n\n\nNon-Functional requirement:\n\n- availability >> consistency\n- latency of sync should be as low as possible\n- resumable uploads\n- high data integratity(sync accuracy)\n\n\nCore Entities:\n\n- Users\n- Files\n- Clients(diff devices for users)\n\n\nAPI : \n\nPOST /upload -> uploadId\nheader: jwt-token\n\nbody: {\n    fileurl\n    filemetadata\n}\n\n\nGET /download-> fileId\nheader: jwt-token\n\nresponse-> {\n    s3-presignedurl\n    filemetadata\n}\n\n\nGET files/changes?since={timestamp} -> changeevent[]\nheader = jwt",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement: \n\n- upload the file\n- download the file\n- sync file acrross multiple devices\n\n\n\nNon-Functional requirement:\n\n- availability >> consistency\n- latency of sync should be as low as possible\n- resumable uploads\n- high data integratity(sync accuracy)\n\n\nCore Entities:\n\n- Users\n- Files\n- Clients(diff devices for users)\n\n\nAPI : \n\nPOST /upload -> uploadId\nheader: jwt-token\n\nbody: {\n    fileurl\n    filemetadata\n}\n\n\nGET /download-> fileId\nheader: jwt-token\n\nresponse-> {\n    s3-presignedurl\n    filemetadata\n}\n\n\nGET files/changes?since={timestamp} -> changeevent[]\nheader = jwt",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
