      "updated": 1788699301353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- how do we make sure that status get uploadted for the chucks?\n\nmethod 1; \n\n      - sent update from the client and upate it in db\n        but we can check s3 (multiple part upload api to see if matching)\n\nmethod 2: \n      - multipart upload feature of the s3, have send notifications\n        which basically notifiy once chucks uploaded.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- how do we make sure that status get uploadted for the chucks?\n\nmethod 1; \n\n      - sent update from the client and upate it in db\n        but we can check s3 (multiple part upload api to see if matching)\n\nmethod 2: \n      - multipart upload feature of the s3, have send notifications\n        which basically notifiy once chucks uploaded.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
