      "seed": 726724886,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 130551178,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788700231967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client                    S3\n\nC3 ──────────────────────→\n                           C3 stored ✅\n       ←── TIMEOUT ───────",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client                    S3\n\nC3 ──────────────────────→\n                           C3 stored ✅\n       ←── TIMEOUT ───────",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "U3Vb7fEwAm7sWuywGDlaC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40164.457785717714,
      "y": 11087.219348178702,
      "width": 1154.9996337890625,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 876528074,
      "version": 9,
      "versionNonce": 1669379082,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788700336677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "uploadId = U123\npartNumber = 3\n\n“A multipart upload is identified by an upload ID and part number. \nIf the same part number is uploaded again for the same upload ID,\nthe latest successful upload is used when completing the multipart upload.”",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "uploadId = U123\npartNumber = 3\n\n“A multipart upload is identified by an upload ID and part number. \nIf the same part number is uploaded again for the same upload ID,\nthe latest successful upload is used when completing the multipart upload.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wRAU6L9GHLtmtQ49UqPNQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40164.63941361278,
      "y": 11464.836219190964,
      "width": 739.19970703125,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1374581526,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1152460182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788700409922,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Client creates the chunk plan\n\nSuppose:\n\nFile = 1 GB\nChunk size = 100 MB\n\nClient calculates:\n\nChunk 1 → bytes 0       - 99MB\nChunk 2 → bytes 100MB   - 199MB\nChunk 3 → bytes 200MB   - 299MB\nChunk 4 → bytes 300MB   - 399MB\n...\nChunk 10 → bytes 900MB  - 999MB\n\nThe client maintains this metadata:\n\nChunk #    Range              URL\n------------------------------------------------\n1          0-99MB             presigned-url-1\n2          100-199MB           presigned-url-2\n3          200-299MB           presigned-url-3\n4          300-399MB           presigned-url-4\n...\n\nSo the client already knows the range.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Client creates the chunk plan\n\nSuppose:\n\nFile = 1 GB\nChunk size = 100 MB\n\nClient calculates:\n\nChunk 1 → bytes 0       - 99MB\nChunk 2 → bytes 100MB   - 199MB\nChunk 3 → bytes 200MB   - 299MB\nChunk 4 → bytes 300MB   - 399MB\n...\nChunk 10 → bytes 900MB  - 999MB\n\nThe client maintains this metadata:\n\nChunk #    Range              URL\n------------------------------------------------\n1          0-99MB             presigned-url-1\n2          100-199MB           presigned-url-2\n3          200-299MB           presigned-url-3\n4          300-399MB           presigned-url-4\n...\n\nSo the client already knows the range.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7BbT_fUFywi0acfYZQ7dJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 41531.501930309394,
      "y": 11780.824170254302,
      "width": 785.399658203125,
      "height": 1470,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 877945610,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 1412359242,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788700504299,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- how to get chuck url if chucks fails to uplaod::\n---------------------------------------------------\n\nApproach A — Get a URL for each part upfront\n\nBackend generates presigned URLs:\n\nBackend\n   ↓\n10 presigned URLs\n   ↓\nClient\n\n---------------------------------------------------\n\nApproach B — Generate URL when needed\n\nIf the URL expires or wasn't generated upfront:\n\nClient\n   ↓\nBackend\n\"I need URL for part 3\"\n   ↓\nBackend\n   ↓\nnew presigned URL\n   ↓\nClient\n   ↓\nC3 → S3\n\nThe backend knows:\n\nuploadId = U123\npartNumber = 3\n\nand generates a new URL for part 3.\n\nThe client still knows that part 3 represents:\n\n200MB - 299MB",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- how to get chuck url if chucks fails to uplaod::\n---------------------------------------------------\n\nApproach A — Get a URL for each part upfront\n\nBackend generates presigned URLs:\n\nBackend\n   ↓\n10 presigned URLs\n   ↓\nClient\n\n---------------------------------------------------\n\nApproach B — Generate URL when needed\n\nIf the URL expires or wasn't generated upfront:\n\nClient\n   ↓\nBackend\n\"I need URL for part 3\"\n   ↓\nBackend\n   ↓\nnew presigned URL\n   ↓\nClient\n   ↓\nC3 → S3\n\nThe backend knows:\n\nuploadId = U123\npartNumber = 3\n\nand generates a new URL for part 3.\n\nThe client still knows that part 3 represents:\n\n200MB - 299MB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Nu3XAYuVicSMeVk0KN9U8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 44750.51521030354,
      "y": 8585.854885626977,
      "width": 1108.799560546875,
      "height": 1645,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 461705930,
      "version": 997,
      "versionNonce": 1937962058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788705203436,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Youtube System design:\n\n\nYouTube is a video-sharing platform that allows users to upload, view, \nand interact with video content.\nAs of this writing, it is the second most visited website in the world \n\n\nFunctional Requirement:\n\n- Users can upload videos.\n- Users can watch (stream) videos.\n\nNon-Functional Requirement:\n\n- aviability >> consistency \n- low latency on stream or while watching video\n- resumable uploads\n- scale upto (1M daily upload && 100M daily watch)\n- system should support large file uploads\n\n\n\n\nEntities\n\n- Videos\n- VideoMetadata\n- User\n\n\n\nAPI:\n\n\n\nPOST videos/upload -> videoid & presignedUrl (expirytime, client access)\nheader: jwt-token\nbody:{\n    videoMetadata\n}\n\n\nGET videos/{videoid}/download  -> presignedurl\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Youtube System design:\n\n\nYouTube is a video-sharing platform that allows users to upload, view, \nand interact with video content.\nAs of this writing, it is the second most visited website in the world \n\n\nFunctional Requirement:\n\n- Users can upload videos.\n- Users can watch (stream) videos.\n\nNon-Functional Requirement:\n\n- aviability >> consistency \n- low latency on stream or while watching video\n- resumable uploads\n- scale upto (1M daily upload && 100M daily watch)\n- system should support large file uploads\n\n\n\n\nEntities\n\n- Videos\n- VideoMetadata\n- User\n\n\n\nAPI:\n\n\n\nPOST videos/upload -> videoid & presignedUrl (expirytime, client access)\nheader: jwt-token\nbody:{\n    videoMetadata\n}\n\n\nGET videos/{videoid}/download  -> presignedurl\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
