    {
      "id": "WatS9qt-weJKQwjsePozW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47003.23013122217,
      "y": 10558.00563279489,
      "width": 1724.7994384765625,
      "height": 2975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1369061206,
      "version": 271,
      "versionNonce": 750245450,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788713106239,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After CompleteMultipartUpload succeeds and the final object is created, S3 can emit an \nObject Created event, which we consume asynchronously through SQS/EventBridge and use to trigger video processin\n-------------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | 1. Ask backend to start upload\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | 2. CreateMultipartUpload\n   v\nS3\n   |\n   | 3. uploadId\n   v\nBackend ---> Client\n              |\n              | 4. Upload Part 1 ---> S3\n              | 5. Upload Part 2 ---> S3\n              | 6. Upload Part 3 ---> S3\n              | ...\n              | N. Upload Part N ---> S3\n              |\n              | Each upload returns ETag\n              v\n           Client\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | \"All parts uploaded\"\n   | + partNumber + ETag list\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | CompleteMultipartUpload\n   | (uploadId + ordered ETags)\n   v\nS3\n   |\n   | Combines parts\n   | into final object\n   v\nS3 Object\n   |\n   | final object key\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | update DB\n   v\nDatabase\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | upload chunks\n   v\n   S3\n   |\n   | CompleteMultipartUpload\n   v\nCompleted S3 Object\n   |\n   | Object-created event\n   v\nS3 Event Notification\n   |\n   v\nSQS / EventBridge / SNS\n   |\n   v\nVideo Processing Service\n   |\n   +----> Transcoding\n   +----> Thumbnail generation\n   +----> Metadata extraction\n   |\n   v\nDatabase\n   status = READY",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After CompleteMultipartUpload succeeds and the final object is created, S3 can emit an \nObject Created event, which we consume asynchronously through SQS/EventBridge and use to trigger video processin\n-------------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | 1. Ask backend to start upload\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | 2. CreateMultipartUpload\n   v\nS3\n   |\n   | 3. uploadId\n   v\nBackend ---> Client\n              |\n              | 4. Upload Part 1 ---> S3\n              | 5. Upload Part 2 ---> S3\n              | 6. Upload Part 3 ---> S3\n              | ...\n              | N. Upload Part N ---> S3\n              |\n              | Each upload returns ETag\n              v\n           Client\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | \"All parts uploaded\"\n   | + partNumber + ETag list\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | CompleteMultipartUpload\n   | (uploadId + ordered ETags)\n   v\nS3\n   |\n   | Combines parts\n   | into final object\n   v\nS3 Object\n   |\n   | final object key\n   v\nBackend\n   |\n   | update DB\n   v\nDatabase\n\n-----------------------------------------------------\n\nClient\n   |\n   | upload chunks\n   v\n   S3\n   |\n   | CompleteMultipartUpload\n   v\nCompleted S3 Object\n   |\n   | Object-created event\n   v\nS3 Event Notification\n   |\n   v\nSQS / EventBridge / SNS\n   |\n   v\nVideo Processing Service\n   |\n   +----> Transcoding\n   +----> Thumbnail generation\n   +----> Metadata extraction\n   |\n   v\nDatabase\n   status = READY",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WIwG-8nYt5_MVKSQnDuHG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 51769.89732478047,
      "y": 8157.406318081824,
      "width": 1077.99951171875,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1197354186,
      "version": 570,
      "versionNonce": 1775995542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788715888750,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vending machine payment integration:\n\nFunctional Requirement:\n\n1. desgin vending machine payment system\n2. user intitiate payment request\n3. scale of 1k request per day\n\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirement:\n\n1. consistency >> avialability \n2. << 1 qps \n3. fault taulrent\n4. system be secure(card details/pay details got logged in out system)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vending machine payment integration:\n\nFunctional Requirement:\n\n1. desgin vending machine payment system\n2. user intitiate payment request\n3. scale of 1k request per day\n\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirement:\n\n1. consistency >> avialability \n2. << 1 qps \n3. fault taulrent\n4. system be secure(card details/pay details got logged in out system)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5UXwdCjwJ5esUzhXbPzXE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 51766.67442209622,
      "y": 8800.70232031674,
      "width": 1262.799560546875,
      "height": 910,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2056398666,
      "version": 843,
      "versionNonce": 1589654806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788717076425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "core entities:\n\n1. VendingMachines\n2. Transctions\n3. Vendormaster\n4. vendorpayprovidermap< -> (vendor -> vm -> payments)\n\n\n\nAPI:\n\nPOST vendings/{vendingmachineid}/initiatepayment -> paymentintentid & paymenttoken\n{\n    amount\n    paymentdetails\n}\n\nPOST vendings/{vendingmachineid}/payment \n{\n    paymentToken\n}\n\nstripe/paypal\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "core entities:\n\n1. VendingMachines\n2. Transctions\n3. Vendormaster\n4. vendorpayprovidermap< -> (vendor -> vm -> payments)\n\n\n\nAPI:\n\nPOST vendings/{vendingmachineid}/initiatepayment -> paymentintentid & paymenttoken\n{\n    amount\n    paymentdetails\n}\n\nPOST vendings/{vendingmachineid}/payment \n{\n    paymentToken\n}\n\nstripe/paypal\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
