    {
      "id": "mu6MRD9biauz4JTDYNtVi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 54244.32756530685,
      "y": 10220.928423876461,
      "width": 662.19970703125,
      "height": 805,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1089585878,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1265861974,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788719247168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "15. Reconciliation\n\nThis is a must-have deep dive for payments.\n\nImagine our DB says:\n\nPAY123 = PROCESSING\n\nbut Stripe says:\n\nSUCCESS\n\nMaybe webhook was lost.\n\nSo periodically:\n\nReconciliation Job\n        ↓\nOur DB\n        ↓\nCompare\n        ↓\nStripe / PayPal",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "15. Reconciliation\n\nThis is a must-have deep dive for payments.\n\nImagine our DB says:\n\nPAY123 = PROCESSING\n\nbut Stripe says:\n\nSUCCESS\n\nMaybe webhook was lost.\n\nSo periodically:\n\nReconciliation Job\n        ↓\nOur DB\n        ↓\nCompare\n        ↓\nStripe / PayPal",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gltNRKVUktnSFsInZQn17",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55392.46075748818,
      "y": 10236.207762935905,
      "width": 846.9996337890625,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJS",
