      "versionNonce": 2085027658,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788719522293,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- we will keep the concilation job when we don't\n    bz we might loss the webhook data/ or response not \n    recieved from the payment provider ",
