      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788719969281,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "token/paymentMethodId",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "token/paymentMethodId",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ASf9awg_4Pe5f8bWGMDS3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 53092.462547156436,
      "y": 10354.256079757659,
      "width": 785.399658203125,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1785533846,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 270333590,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788721862371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The payment details are collected through the\nprovider's secure terminal/SDK rather than our\nbackend. The provider returns a payment method\ntoken or payment session identifier to the vending\nmachine/application. The machine sends that\nidentifier, along with the transaction ID and\namount, to our backend over mutually authenticated\nTLS. Our Payment Service then uses the provider\ntoken to initiate or confirm the payment. We never\nneed to receive or store the raw card number or CVV",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The payment details are collected through the provider's secure terminal/SDK rather than our backend. The provider returns a payment method token or payment session identifier to the vending machine/application. The machine sends that identifier, along with the transaction ID and amount, to our backend over mutually authenticated TLS. Our Payment Service then uses the provider token to initiate or confirm the payment. We never need to receive or store the raw card number or CVV",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DsMpbM09LIum5Qi3C9qu9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56588.19150527562,
      "y": 9541.47521773401,
      "width": 723.7942504882812,
      "height": 2975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 435935562,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 1091222858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788721160494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Customer\n   │\n   │ Selects product ₹100\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │ ① \"I want to pay ₹100\"\n   │\n   │ POST /payments\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ Validate product + calculate amount\n   │ amount = ₹100\n   │\n   │ ② Create PaymentIntent\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Creates:\n   │ PaymentIntent = pi_123\n   │\n   │ Returns client_secret / payment identifier\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ Store:\n   │ PAY123\n   │ pi_123\n   │ ₹100\n   │ PROCESSING\n   │\n   │ ③ Return payment information\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │\n   │ ④ Start secure card-payment flow\n   ▼\nStripe Terminal / Secure Payment SDK\n   │\n   │\n   │ ⑤ CUSTOMER TAPS / INSERTS CARD\n   │\n   │ Card details\n   │ ──────────────────────────────►\n   │                                Stripe\n   │\n   │     RAW CARD DATA STAYS\n   │     INSIDE SECURE PAYMENT FLOW\n   │\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Processes payment against\n   │ PaymentIntent pi_123\n   │\n   ▼\nBank / Card Network\n   │\n   │\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Payment succeeded\n   │\n   │ ⑥ Webhook\n   ▼\nOur Webhook API\n   │\n   │ POST /webhooks/stripe\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ ⑦ Update payment\n   ▼\nPayment DB\n   │\n   │ PAY123 = SUCCESS\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │ ⑧ Dispense product\n   ▼\nProduct",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Customer\n   │\n   │ Selects product ₹100\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │ ① \"I want to pay ₹100\"\n   │\n   │ POST /payments\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ Validate product + calculate amount\n   │ amount = ₹100\n   │\n   │ ② Create PaymentIntent\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Creates:\n   │ PaymentIntent = pi_123\n   │\n   │ Returns client_secret / payment identifier\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ Store:\n   │ PAY123\n   │ pi_123\n   │ ₹100\n   │ PROCESSING\n   │\n   │ ③ Return payment information\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │\n   │ ④ Start secure card-payment flow\n   ▼\nStripe Terminal / Secure Payment SDK\n   │\n   │\n   │ ⑤ CUSTOMER TAPS / INSERTS CARD\n   │\n   │ Card details\n   │ ──────────────────────────────►\n   │                                Stripe\n   │\n   │     RAW CARD DATA STAYS\n   │     INSIDE SECURE PAYMENT FLOW\n   │\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Processes payment against\n   │ PaymentIntent pi_123\n   │\n   ▼\nBank / Card Network\n   │\n   │\n   ▼\nStripe\n   │\n   │ Payment succeeded\n   │\n   │ ⑥ Webhook\n   ▼\nOur Webhook API\n   │\n   │ POST /webhooks/stripe\n   ▼\nPayment Service\n   │\n   │ ⑦ Update payment\n   ▼\nPayment DB\n   │\n   │ PAY123 = SUCCESS\n   ▼\nVending Machine\n   │\n   │ ⑧ Dispense product\n   ▼\nProduct",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
