      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788721876659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So don't think of it as:\nUI → PaymentMethodId → Backend → Stripe → Confirm\n\nas a universal rule.\n\nthought ont this???",
