    {
      "id": "Y1xHUMruyIYnSIhrQoyOC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75636.47397278262,
      "y": 8950.033407438223,
      "width": 1000.9996337890625,
      "height": 1995,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bM8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1616206870,
      "version": 1014,
      "versionNonce": 1848963286,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788809397675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Vending machine inventory managment:\n\nfunctional requirement;\n - Manage vending machines\n - Manage inventory\n - Purchase a product\n - paysupported payment\n - Monitor machine status\n\n\n\nnon-functional requirement:\n\n- latency of checkout should be < 1s(delay from payment provider)\n- scale update 1k request per second\n- avialability > consistency ??\n\n\ncore entities\n\n- Vendingmachine\n- Inventory\n- Payments\n- transctions\n\nrack : {\n        rackid\n        itemid\n        price\n        quanity\n    }\n\nAPI:\n\n\nPOST vm/updateInventary -> inventoryid\n{\n   vmnumber\n   Rack[]\n}\n\nPOST vm/checkout -> orderid\n{\n    vmnumber\n    itemid\n    amount\n}\n\nPost vm/payment -> paymentintent\n{\n    orderid\n    carddetails\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vending machine inventory managment:\n\nfunctional requirement;\n - Manage vending machines\n - Manage inventory\n - Purchase a product\n - paysupported payment\n - Monitor machine status\n\n\n\nnon-functional requirement:\n\n- latency of checkout should be < 1s(delay from payment provider)\n- scale update 1k request per second\n- avialability > consistency ??\n\n\ncore entities\n\n- Vendingmachine\n- Inventory\n- Payments\n- transctions\n\nrack : {\n        rackid\n        itemid\n        price\n        quanity\n    }\n\nAPI:\n\n\nPOST vm/updateInventary -> inventoryid\n{\n   vmnumber\n   Rack[]\n}\n\nPOST vm/checkout -> orderid\n{\n    vmnumber\n    itemid\n    amount\n}\n\nPost vm/payment -> paymentintent\n{\n    orderid\n    carddetails\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
