    {
      "id": "__5S86rPoNt-fULhaF5wV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 71581.55261173277,
      "y": 1704.0892322527152,
      "width": 1567.5777101890856,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ced4da",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 626603559,
      "version": 25,
      "versionNonce": 1451282055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792498710212,
      "created": 1792498702307,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Precompute embeddings — once per question\nStore in Cosmos DB\nGenerate an embedding when a PYQ is added or updated. Reuse it for future\nsearches.\n\n\n\n\n2. Retrieve candidates — on each search\nRuntime\nUse vector search to find the top 50 similar questions, then filter by exam,\nstage, and paper as required.\n\n\n\n\n3. Cross-encoder reranking — on candidates\nRuntime or cached\nScore the current question against the retrieved candidates. Cache results for\nrecurring question pairs.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Precompute embeddings — once per question\nStore in Cosmos DB\nGenerate an embedding when a PYQ is added or updated. Reuse it for future searches.\n\n\n\n\n2. Retrieve candidates — on each search\nRuntime\nUse vector search to find the top 50 similar questions, then filter by exam, stage, and paper as required.\n\n\n\n\n3. Cross-encoder reranking — on candidates\nRuntime or cached\nScore the current question against the retrieved candidates. Cache results for recurring question pairs.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dkLLTDYYj22lFpCiE1Xi-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 74510.76398212102,
      "y": 3020.3758795745034,
      "width": 1395.456559262705,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ced4da",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20734554,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 889701914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792815050258,
      "created": 1792814988541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "│ Match     │ Shared concept ID with Q12021870              │ Cosine │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┤\n│ Q20000601 │ none                                          │ 0.911  │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┤\n│ Q110067   │ igneous_cooling_rate_grain_size (the same ID) │ 0.886  │\n\n\nwe should drive the match score based on other factor as well like\ncosine similarity + shared concepts + ??",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "│ Match     │ Shared concept ID with Q12021870              │ Cosine │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┤\n│ Q20000601 │ none                                          │ 0.911  │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┤\n│ Q110067   │ igneous_cooling_rate_grain_size (the same ID) │ 0.886  │\n\n\nwe should drive the match score based on other factor as well like cosine similarity + shared concepts + ??",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9VPsMC6RgU75ooOwCh4cz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 68501.36152536646,
      "y": 1660.5646811437487,
      "width": 1930.707028042422,
      "height": 2835,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ced4da",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1860576262,
      "version": 288,
      "versionNonce": 1089384134,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792863470416,
      "created": 1792863420880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Caching the similarity questions:\n\n══════════ READ PATH (every user) ══════════\n\n User opens similarity popup\n          │\n          ▼\n GET /api/similarity?questionId=X\n          │\n          ▼\n ┌─────────────────┐\n │   Vercel CDN    │\n └──┬───────────┬──┘\n   HIT         MISS\n    │           │\n    │           ▼\n    │   Function: compute from Cosmos\n    │     • load X profile + candidates' embeddings\n    │     • cosine + rank → top 12\n    │     • tag the response:\n    │         similarity, q-X, q-m1 … q-m12\n    │     • Cache-Control: public, s-maxage=1 year\n    │           │\n    │           ▼\n    │   CDN stores response\n    │           │\n    ▼           ▼\n JSON returned to user\n\n\n══════════ PURGE PATH (admin, manual) ══════════\n\n Admin portal\n   [ Master question ID: X ]  [ Purge similarity cache ]\n          │\n          ▼\n POST /api/admin/purge-similarity { questionId: X }\n          │\n          ▼\n 1. Check admin identity  ── not admin ──► 403\n          │\n          ▼\n 2. Find X's top ~30 similar questions (m1 … m30)\n          │\n          ▼\n 3. Build tag list:\n      q-X       ← X's own result + every result that already listed X\n      q-m1…q-m30 ← neighbours that may now list X\n          │\n          ▼\n 4. Vercel invalidate by tag\n          │\n          ▼\n 5. Return { purged: N }  ──► portal shows \"Purged N questions\"\n          │\n          ▼\n Next user request for any of those ─► MISS ─► recomputed from Cosmos ─► cached again\n\n\n══════════ WHEN TO USE PURGE ══════════\n\n Embedding / concept refresh, corrected question, retired question\n   → write to Cosmos first → then purge in the admin porta",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Caching the similarity questions:\n\n══════════ READ PATH (every user) ══════════\n\n User opens similarity popup\n          │\n          ▼\n GET /api/similarity?questionId=X\n          │\n          ▼\n ┌─────────────────┐\n │   Vercel CDN    │\n └──┬───────────┬──┘\n   HIT         MISS\n    │           │\n    │           ▼\n    │   Function: compute from Cosmos\n    │     • load X profile + candidates' embeddings\n    │     • cosine + rank → top 12\n    │     • tag the response:\n    │         similarity, q-X, q-m1 … q-m12\n    │     • Cache-Control: public, s-maxage=1 year\n    │           │\n    │           ▼\n    │   CDN stores response\n    │           │\n    ▼           ▼\n JSON returned to user\n\n\n══════════ PURGE PATH (admin, manual) ══════════\n\n Admin portal\n   [ Master question ID: X ]  [ Purge similarity cache ]\n          │\n          ▼\n POST /api/admin/purge-similarity { questionId: X }\n          │\n          ▼\n 1. Check admin identity  ── not admin ──► 403\n          │\n          ▼\n 2. Find X's top ~30 similar questions (m1 … m30)\n          │\n          ▼\n 3. Build tag list:\n      q-X       ← X's own result + every result that already listed X\n      q-m1…q-m30 ← neighbours that may now list X\n          │\n          ▼\n 4. Vercel invalidate by tag\n          │\n          ▼\n 5. Return { purged: N }  ──► portal shows \"Purged N questions\"\n          │\n          ▼\n Next user request for any of those ─► MISS ─► recomputed from Cosmos ─► cached again\n\n\n══════════ WHEN TO USE PURGE ══════════\n\n Embedding / concept refresh, corrected question, retired question\n   → write to Cosmos first → then purge in the admin porta",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
